abstract: >-
  A digital card sorting tool for the formative assessment of students'
  understanding of machine learning concepts. Learners freely group short
  problem descriptions; a teacher dashboard compares their sortings with
  expert structures based on deep (learning method) and surface features.
keywords:
  - card sorting
  - formative assessment
  - machine learning
  - AI education
  - computing education
